5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I’m curious how much time we lose to out-of-service rooms during construction, and how those spaces are actually used afterward.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’m concerned about the staff burden. Who is left to maintain these new facilities once the contractors leave?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I’m worried about the calendar. Every recent job hits an unpriced snag, and the schedule slips until a year of work is squeezed into the remaining weeks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m interested in the gap between approved figures and actual market costs, and what happens to the budget after the building opens.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, your concern about slipping schedules is valid. I’d like to see the decade of delivery schedules to understand why some projects consistently miss their targets.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, I agree. I’d like to examine the timetable records for out-of-service rooms to see how long we lose space during construction.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, your point about the calendar is well taken. I’d like to check the staffing posts since the hiring freeze to see who is left to handle the upkeep.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I agree. I’ll look into the decade of delivery schedules to see why comfort-based projects slip so badly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, I’ll examine the tender records to see how market prices have drifted from our approved figures.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
