53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, agreed. Shared access is key. But my weather data shows six weeks lost to rain. We must avoid exposed work to protect the schedule.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
